        <para id="para-00038">Over the next few days, the same 5 friends practiced walking and
          texting to see if
          they could walk faster and text more characters. They did not record any more data while
          practicing. After practicing, each of the 5 friends took another 4 walks. Here are the
          results of the final 20 walks.</para>
        <media alt="Scatter plot showing the number of characters texted on the y-axis versus the distance in feet on the x-axis. The data points show a downward trend as distance increases from 120 to 240 feet.">
          <image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/Algebra-1_03_06_09_10.svg"/>
        </media>

